  "invariants": [
    "Plain empty Enter activates only the mounted waiting spend action. Drafts, IME, repeated keys and library navigation cannot authorize it.",
    "Waiting receipts remain visible with their existing localized approval label. Concurrent work keeps its own progress.",
    "A quote may be confirmed from the composer once. A retry requires direct interaction. A subsequent quote accepts Enter after it has been visible for 500 ms.",
    "The host projects approval only during the creator decision phase of a call. Settlement can outlive that phase.",
    "The host admits the pair of quote identity and displayed handover revision at most once. The next retry comes from the updated card."
  ],
